{
  "chapters": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "section",
      "number": "198",
      "id": "198",
      "title": "Tax on long-term capital gains in certain cases.",
      "x": 27.62,
      "y_start": 80.59,
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 1,
      "text_before_subsections": "",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "1",
          "id": "198-1",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 95.44,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Irrespective of anything contained in section 197, the tax payable by an assessee on his total income shall be determined as per the provisions of sub-section (2), if—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "198-1-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "the total income includes any income chargeable under the head \"Capital gains\";",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "198-1-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "the capital gains arise from the transfer of a long-term capital asset being an equity share in a company or a unit of an equity oriented fund or a unit of a business trust;",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "c",
              "id": "198-1-c",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 430.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "securities transaction tax under Chapter VII of the Finance (No. 2) Act, 2004 (23 of 2004) has—",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "i",
                  "id": "198-1-c-i",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 465.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "in a case where the long-term capital asset is in the nature of an equity share in a company, been paid on acquisition and transfer of such capital asset; or"
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub-clause",
                  "number": "ii",
                  "id": "198-1-c-ii",
                  "x": 55.0,
                  "y_start": 480.0,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "in a case where the long-term capital asset is in the nature of a unit of an equity oriented fund or a unit of a business trust, been paid on transfer of such capital asset."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-198-1-001",
              "target_id": "198-2",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (2)",
              "relationship": "depends_on",
              "confidence": "high"
            },
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-198-1-002",
              "target_id": "197",
              "target_type": "section",
              "anchor_text": "section 197",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "2",
          "id": "198-2",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "The tax payable by the assessee on the total income referred to in sub-section (1) shall be the aggregate of—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "198-2-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "income-tax calculated on such long-term capital gains exceeding Rs. 125000 at the rate of 12.5%; and",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "198-2-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "income-tax payable on the total income as reduced by long-term capital gains referred to in sub-section (1) as if the total income so reduced were the total income of the assessee.",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-198-2-b-001",
                  "target_id": "198-1",
                  "target_type": "subsection",
                  "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)",
                  "relationship": "related_to",
                  "confidence": "high"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-198-2-001",
              "target_id": "198-1",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "3",
          "id": "198-3",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "In the case of an individual or a Hindu undivided family, being a resident, where the total income as reduced by long-term capital gains computed under sub-section (1) is below the maximum amount which is not chargeable to income-tax, then,—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "198-3-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "such long-term capital gains shall be reduced by the amount by which the total income as so reduced falls short of the maximum amount which is not chargeable to income-tax; and",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "198-3-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "the tax on the balance of such long-term capital gains shall be computed at the rate as referred to in sub-section (2).",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-198-3-b-001",
                  "target_id": "198-2",
                  "target_type": "subsection",
                  "anchor_text": "sub-section (2)",
                  "relationship": "related_to",
                  "confidence": "high"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-198-3-001",
              "target_id": "198-1",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)",
              "relationship": "depends_on",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "4",
          "id": "198-4",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "The condition specified in sub-section (1)(c) shall not apply to a transfer undertaken on a recognised stock exchange located in any International Financial Services Centre and where the consideration for such transfer is received or receivable in foreign currency.",
          "clauses": [],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-198-4-001",
              "target_id": "198-1-c",
              "target_type": "clause",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)(c)",
              "relationship": "exception_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "5",
          "id": "198-5",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "The Central Government may, by notification, specify the nature of acquisition in respect of which the provisions of sub-section (1)(c)(i) shall not apply.",
          "clauses": [],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-198-5-001",
              "target_id": "198-1-c",
              "target_type": "clause",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)(c)",
              "relationship": "exception_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "6",
          "id": "198-6",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Where the gross total income of an assessee includes any long-term capital gains referred to in sub-section (1), the deduction under Chapter VIII shall be allowed from the gross total income as reduced by such capital gains.",
          "clauses": [],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-198-6-001",
              "target_id": "198-1",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "7",
          "id": "198-7",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Where the total income of an assessee includes any long-term capital gains referred to in sub-section (1), the rebate under section 156 shall be allowed from the income-tax on the total income as reduced by tax payable on such capital gains.",
          "clauses": [],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-198-7-001",
              "target_id": "198-1",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            },
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-198-7-002",
              "target_id": "156",
              "target_type": "section",
              "anchor_text": "section 156",
              "relationship": "depends_on",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "8",
          "id": "198-8",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "For the purposes of this section, the expression \"equity oriented fund\" means a fund set up under a scheme of a mutual fund specified in Schedule VII (Table: Sl. No. 20 or 21) or under a scheme of an insurance company comprising unit linked insurance policies to which exemption in Schedule II (Table: Sl. No. 2) does not apply and—",
